The registry-first sample tests/registry/hk.jsonl contains building numbers, street and village
names, location names, districts, regions and coordinates from the Address Lookup Service (ALS)
of the Digital Policy Office of the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region,
downloaded from DATA.GOV.HK (https://data.gov.hk/en-data/dataset/hk-dpo-als_01-als) as
"Addresses from Address Lookup Service" (https://www.als.gov.hk/data/ALS-GeoJSON.zip).
Source: Digital Policy Office, the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, and
DATA.GOV.HK. The Government and the Relevant Organisations own the intellectual property rights in
the Data. Used under the DATA.GOV.HK Terms and Conditions of Use, version 1.2
(https://data.gov.hk/en/terms-and-conditions).
Queries were constructed from each record's own fields (English: number, street or village,
location, district, region; Chinese: region, district, location, street or village, number and
號); coordinates are the published WGS84 points, unchanged. The release, its SHA-256 and the
retrieval date are recorded in each case and in docs/evaluation/registry/hk.md.
